{
  "uid": "pelican-trace",
  "title": "Pelican download lookup",
  "description": "Everything recorded for one download: its spans from every service, and how to find its log lines on each service.",
  "tags": [
    "pelican",
    "tracing"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "refresh": "",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "Trace ID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "",
            "value": ""
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "The download to analyze. Click a trace ID in the table, or paste one, such as the trace_id field of a Pelican log line."
      },
      {
        "name": "find",
        "label": "Find by attribute",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "",
            "value": ""
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0,
        "description": "Narrows the table of downloads, as key=value pairs, e.g. pelican.object.path=/demo/fixed/obj-1.bin"
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "What Pelican tracing answers",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "url": "/d/pelican-questions/what-pelican-tracing-answers",
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Pelican object downloads",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "url": "/d/pelican-downloads/pelican-object-downloads",
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Find a download",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "How to use this page",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This page shows everything recorded for **one download**: its spans from every service, and how to find the log lines those services wrote for it.\n\n**Pick a download** in either of two ways:\n\n1. Click a trace ID in the table on the right.\n2. Paste a trace ID into the **Trace ID** box at the top: the `trace_id=` field of an origin, cache or client log line.\n\n**Narrow the table** with **Find by attribute**, e.g. `pelican.object.path=/demo/fixed/obj-1.bin`, `pelican.job_id=<X-Pelican-JobId>` or `error=true`.\n\nLogs stay on each service; the section at the bottom shows how to search them."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Downloads (newest first) — click a trace ID to analyze it",
      "description": "client.transfer traces from Jaeger, filtered by the Find by attribute box. A download whose client did not trace has no row here; paste a server's trace ID from its log instead.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "jaeger",
        "uid": "pelican-traces"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "pelican-traces"
          },
          "queryType": "search",
          "service": "pelican-client",
          "operation": "client.transfer",
          "tags": "${find}",
          "limit": 50
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceID"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Trace ID"
              },
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Analyze this download",
                    "url": "/d/pelican-trace/pelican-download-lookup?var-trace_id=${__value.raw}&${find:queryparam}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceName"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Trace"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "startTime"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Start time"
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "dateTimeAsIso"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "duration"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Duration"
              },
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "µs"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Start time",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Download ${trace_id}",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Spans",
      "description": "Spans recorded for this download, by every service.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "jaeger",
        "uid": "pelican-traces"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "pelican-traces"
          },
          "query": "${trace_id}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/^spanID \\(count\\)$/"
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {
              "traceID": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "spanID": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "count"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "serviceName": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "distinctCount"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "duration": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "max"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Services",
      "description": "Distinct services that recorded a span. Four means client, director, cache and origin all took part.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "jaeger",
        "uid": "pelican-traces"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 11
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "pelican-traces"
          },
          "query": "${trace_id}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/^serviceName \\(distinctCount\\)$/"
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {
              "traceID": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "spanID": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "count"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "serviceName": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "distinctCount"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "duration": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "max"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Total duration",
      "description": "The longest span, which is the client's client.transfer when the client traced the download.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "jaeger",
        "uid": "pelican-traces"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 11
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "pelican-traces"
          },
          "query": "${trace_id}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0",
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/^duration \\(max\\)$/"
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {
              "traceID": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "spanID": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "count"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "serviceName": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "distinctCount"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "duration": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "max"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "traces",
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Timeline",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "jaeger",
        "uid": "pelican-traces"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "description": "Every span of the download. Click a span for its attributes (pelican.*), its events (exception, director.decision) and a 'Logs for this span' link.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "pelican-traces"
          },
          "query": "${trace_id}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Time by service and stage",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "jaeger",
        "uid": "pelican-traces"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "description": "Spans grouped by service and name. Parent spans include their children's time, so the totals overlap.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "pelican-traces"
          },
          "query": "${trace_id}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "groupBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {
              "serviceName": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "operationName": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "spanID": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "count"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "duration": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum",
                  "max"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "serviceName": "Service",
              "operationName": "Span",
              "spanID (count)": "Count",
              "duration (sum)": "Total",
              "duration (max)": "Longest"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Total",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/^(Total|Longest)$/"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "mode": "basic",
                  "valueDisplayMode": "text"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Spans",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "jaeger",
        "uid": "pelican-traces"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 14,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 33
      },
      "description": "One row per span, in start order, with its attributes. Filter a column to find, for example, every span of one service.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "jaeger",
            "uid": "pelican-traces"
          },
          "query": "${trace_id}"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "convertFieldType",
          "options": {
            "conversions": [
              {
                "targetField": "startTime",
                "destinationType": "time"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "traceID": true,
              "serviceTags": true,
              "logs": true,
              "references": true,
              "warnings": true,
              "stackTraces": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "startTime": 0,
              "serviceName": 1,
              "operationName": 2,
              "duration": 3,
              "tags": 4,
              "spanID": 5,
              "parentSpanID": 6
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "startTime": "Start",
              "serviceName": "Service",
              "operationName": "Span",
              "duration": "Duration",
              "tags": "Attributes",
              "spanID": "Span ID",
              "parentSpanID": "Parent span ID"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Start",
                "desc": false
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Duration"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "ms"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Start"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "time:HH:mm:ss.SSS"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 110
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Service"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 130
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Attributes"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "json-view"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.inspect",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": "/span ID$/i"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 150
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Logs for this download (on each service)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": 15,
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Logs are not collected centrally.\nEach service keeps its own log, as it would on its own host in a real federation, and the origin, the cache and the client write the trace ID on their request lines.\nRun these from `design/opentelemetry/demo`:\n\n```\nmake trace-logs id=${trace_id}\n```\n\nor, on one service:\n\n```\ndocker compose exec cache grep 'trace_id=${trace_id}' /var/log/pelican/cache.log\ndocker compose exec origin grep 'trace_id=${trace_id}' /var/log/pelican/origin.log\ndocker compose exec exerciser grep 'trace_id=${trace_id}' /var/log/pelican/client.log\n```\n\nThe director's lines carry its own request ID instead, which is `pelican.job_id` on its `director.redirect` span."
      }
    }
  ]
}
